ds where its index wraps).","fields: the story fields recorded, in order. cases: name; star (starmap order), planet, moon (-1 for the planet); state (the story fields set, NAME=VALUE, and RETRIEVED, the energy nodes taken as a mask); entered (orbit reached); graphics (every graphic generateOrbital loaded, in order); sheet (whether it set PlanetSideFrame[1], the energy node's image); discovery (the discovery string generateOrbital left: [table, index], or null); energy and life (the nodes generateEnergy and generateLife give); orbit_fields (the story fields after generateOrbital). pickup, for a case with one: scan (1 energy, 2 biological), node, taken (the pickup function's result: the node removed), takeoffs (SetLanderTakeoff's calls), reports (each lander report DoDiscoveryReport showed, [table, index]), discovery (the discovery string left after it), fields (the story fields after it) and, where the pickup itself changed it, retrieved (the energy nodes' retrieved mask after it: the Androsynth's ruins mark those visited in its upper 16 bits). orbit_reports, where generateOrbital itself showed any (Procyon's starbase): [table, index] each. again, for a case touching more nodes in the same orbit: each further pickup as pickup is, in order.","Fwiffo on Pluto (stage 3c item 7): the state's LANDER_CREW is the lander's crew as it touches him; the pickup's kill_crew, where it called KillLanderCrewSeq, is [numKilled, period (ticks of ONE_SECOND 840), the crew before, the crew after], the crew lost one at a time while any are left as lander.c's loop loses them (lander-killcrew.json records lander.c's own), its result whether any are left."],"fields":["SHOFIXTI_MAIDENS","MAIDENS_ON_SHIP","VUX_BEAST","VUX_BEAST_ON_SHIP","UMGAH_BROADCASTERS","UMGAH_BROADCASTERS_ON_SHIP","SPATHI_SHIELDED_SELVES","BURVIXESE_BROADCASTERS","BURV_BROADCASTERS_ON_SHIP","UTWIG_BOMB","UTWIG_BOMB_ON_SHIP","DRUUGE_MANNER","DRUUGE_VISITS","DRUUGE_HOME_VISITS","BOMB_UNPROTECTED","TAALO_PROTECTOR","TAALO_P